# A library that is rejected on purpose.
#
# `expr` matches `expr` at argument 1, so the matcher would descend into itself
# without ever consuming a token. Before the load-time guard existed this passed
# `capy check` and then aborted the process with a stack overflow.
#
# The golden for this sample is the ERROR, not output.

extension txt

function expr
    arg capture lhs expr
    arg literal "+"
    arg capture rhs term
end

function term
    arg capture n any
end
